Adapt RDO's rpm-master python-tooz.spec to the released 2026.1 tarball
(tooz 8.1.0).

Two changes.

1. Optional coordination-driver backends are missing on EL10:

       python3dist(kubernetes) >= 2.8.1      is needed by python-tooz-8.1.0
       python3dist(python-consul2) >= 0.0.16 is needed by python-tooz-8.1.0
       python3dist(sherlock) >= 0.4.1        is needed by python-tooz-8.1.0
       python3dist(sysv-ipc) >= 0.6.8        is needed by python-tooz-8.1.0

   All four appear only in test-requirements.txt and back drivers nothing here
   uses. The spec already tried to strip the tox extras that used to carry them
   with `sed -i 's/deps = .\[zake.*/deps =/' tox.ini`, but tooz 8.1.0's
   [testenv] deps are plain -r includes now, so that no longer matches. Added to
   excluded_brs, which is applied to test-requirements.txt in %prep.

2. The zake extra no longer exists:

       *** PYTHON_EXTRAS_NOT_FOUND_ERROR___SEE_STDERR ***

   tooz 8.1.0's optional-dependencies are consul, etcd, etcd3gw, redis,
   postgresql, mysql, zookeeper, memcached, ipc and kubernetes. zake is gone, so
   the extras subpackage list drops it and keeps the two that remain.

3. The main package also carried an explicit

       Requires: python3-tooz+zake = %{version}-%{release}

   which, with the extras subpackage gone, made python3-tooz uninstallable:

       nothing provides python3-tooz+zake = 8.1.0-1.el10
         needed by python3-tooz-8.1.0-1.el10

   This was the last thing standing between the build and a clean install.

diff -ur a/tooz/python-tooz.spec b/tooz/python-tooz.spec
--- a/python-tooz.spec	2026-09-28 17:13:05.084600894 +0000
+++ b/python-tooz.spec	2026-09-28 18:19:23.541903825 +0000
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@
 
 %{!?upstream_version: %global upstream_version %{version}%{?milestone}}
 # we are excluding some BRs from automatic generator
-%global excluded_brs doc8 bandit pre-commit hacking flake8-import-order pifpaf
+%global excluded_brs kubernetes python-consul2 sherlock sysv-ipc doc8 bandit pre-commit hacking flake8-import-order pifpaf
 # Exclude sphinx from BRs if docs are disabled
 %if ! 0%{?with_doc}
 %global excluded_brs %{excluded_brs} sphinx openstackdocstheme
@@ -49,7 +49,6 @@
 BuildRequires:  python3-devel
 BuildRequires:  pyproject-rpm-macros
 
-Requires:  python3-%{pypi_name}+zake = %{version}-%{release}
 Requires:  python3-%{pypi_name}+redis = %{version}-%{release}
 
 %description -n python3-%{pypi_name}
@@ -118,7 +117,7 @@
 %pyproject_install
 rm -fr %{buildroot}%{python3_sitelib}/%{pypi_name}/tests/
 
-%pyproject_extras_subpkg -n python3-%{pypi_name} zake redis etcd3gw
+%pyproject_extras_subpkg -n python3-%{pypi_name} redis etcd3gw
 
 %files -n python3-%{pypi_name}
